1
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,345
Grandpa's birthday is on Saturday.

2
00:00:05,475 --> 00:00:07,703
Mm-hm. What do you want to give him?

3
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:11,309
His almond cookies. The ones he always buys.

4
00:00:11,439 --> 00:00:14,879
But this time... I want to buy them myself.

5
00:00:15,009 --> 00:00:16,299
With your own money?

6
00:00:16,429 --> 00:00:17,776
Every coin.

7
00:00:19,033 --> 00:00:21,108
Morning, Max! Just you today?

8
00:00:21,238 --> 00:00:24,043
Just me. Just these, please.

9
00:00:24,173 --> 00:00:26,052
That's four twenty-five.

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:31,412
Twenty-five... fifty... seventy-five...

11
00:00:31,542 --> 00:00:34,460
a dollar... a dollar... um...

12
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,250
Hey. Take your time, buddy.

13
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,700
It's okay.

14
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:45,716
I'll come back.

15
00:00:51,767 --> 00:00:52,953
No cookies?

16
00:00:53,083 --> 00:00:56,905
I couldn't count it fast enough. There were people waiting.

17
00:00:57,735 --> 00:00:59,221
That's a hard moment.

18
00:00:59,751 --> 00:01:02,504
Want to practise a little? Just ten minutes.

19
00:01:02,634 --> 00:01:03,891
...Right now?

20
00:01:04,021 --> 00:01:05,360
Right now. Just us.

21
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:09,623
Quarter, quarter... that's fifty.

22
00:01:09,753 --> 00:01:10,968
And the next one?

23
00:01:11,098 --> 00:01:12,524
Seventy-five!

24
00:01:13,467 --> 00:01:16,509
A dollar ten... no, wait.

25
00:01:17,039 --> 00:01:18,574
A dollar fifteen.

26
00:01:18,704 --> 00:01:20,130
You caught that yourself.

27
00:01:20,967 --> 00:01:24,369
Four dollars... and twenty-five cents.

28
00:01:25,933 --> 00:01:27,837
Four twenty-five, right?

29
00:01:27,967 --> 00:01:28,911
Right.

30
00:01:29,041 --> 00:01:33,077
One, two, three, four dollars. And twenty-five cents.

31
00:01:33,507 --> 00:01:35,060
Exactly right.

32
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,180
Nice counting.

33
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,742
Happy birthday, Grandpa.

34
00:01:39,872 --> 00:01:41,609
My almond cookies!

35
00:01:41,739 --> 00:01:45,287
I bought them myself. I counted every coin.

36
00:01:46,017 --> 00:01:47,434
Every coin?

37
00:01:47,564 --> 00:01:49,018
Every single one.

38
00:01:51,167 --> 00:01:53,276
It was never really about the cookies.

39
00:01:53,933 --> 00:01:56,729
Sometimes practice shows up far from the page.

40
00:01:57,179 --> 00:02:00,962
In a gift they chose... and paid for, all by themselves.

